1. Backport of TanStack/ai#1494 (issue #1447): a Responses stream that ends
   without a terminal event reports a RUN_ERROR with code incomplete-stream
   instead of an invented RUN_FINISHED. Remove with @tanstack/openai-base
   >= 0.12.0.
2. The RUN_ERROR for response.incomplete carries the response's usage, so a
   reply cut off at max_output_tokens still reports what it spent. Upstream
   PR to be opened; remove when released.

